// CreepingBorders Mod - Policy Option Localization Strings
// These strings are used for policy option display names, descriptions, confirmations, and notifications

// Region Selector Placeholder - Set Capital
// Hed: Used as display name and target selection header
UI.Notifications.CreepingBorders.RegionSelectorPlaceholder.Hed=Set Capital
// Detail: Used as description text
UI.Notifications.CreepingBorders.RegionSelectorPlaceholder.Detail=Select a region to set as your nation's capital. (Costs 90 influence)
// Summary: Used as confirmation prompt template with {0} = target region name
UI.Notifications.CreepingBorders.RegionSelectorPlaceholder.Summary=Set {0} as capital?

// Legitimise Claim - Convert Hostile Claim to Friendly
// Hed: Used as display name and target selection header
UI.Notifications.CreepingBorders.LegitimiseClaimOption.Hed=Legitimise Claim
// Detail: Used as description text
UI.Notifications.CreepingBorders.LegitimiseClaimOption.Detail=Convert a hostile claim to a friendly claim. (Costs 90 influence)
// Summary: Used as confirmation prompt template with {0} = nation name, {1} = target region name
UI.Notifications.CreepingBorders.LegitimiseClaimOption.Summary=Legitimise claim on {1}?
